<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Percent of total instances that are verbatim parroted for the constituent parts of phone numbers (split by area code and rest of the number). Note that this corresponds to the percent of instances with that component achieving a <span id="A3.T5.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">ParrotScore</span> of 1. We find that verbatim parroting increases with model size for area codes generally, but not for the rest of the number.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
